                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you say what is the concrete use-case for `xyz.openbmc_project.Configuration.Battery` in upstream code?\n\ni.e. which service will consume this configuration"
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/aspeed/ast2600_evb_batterystatus.json",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Concrete use-case is RTC/CMOS battery health exposure on AST2600 EVB through a discrete battery sensor object.\nThe consumer is the dbus-sensors batterystatus daemon. It reads Configuration.Battery via GetSensorConfiguration in BatteryStatusMain.cpp (sensorType = Battery, getConfiguration call), then publishes the battery sensor object on D-Bus. Service entry is xyz.openbmc_project.batterystatus.service.\nSo, this configuration is intended specifically for that BatteryStatus consumer path."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/aspeed/ast2600_evb_batterystatus.json",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks, sorry, i must have somehow overlooked your gerrit topic where the BatteryStatus service is implemented https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/90658"
                },
